== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: invept [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP4, OPC: 0xF0]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: VTX
    ISA-SET: APX_F_VMX
    ISA-EXT: APXEVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: APX_EVEX_INVEPT
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX IS_PRIVILEGED CPUFLAG_ACCESS ACCEPTS_SEGMENT HAS_EEVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 EC 7E 08 F0 65 10 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R     MODRM_REG     64      1      64       INT                          r20
 1     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM    128      1     128       INT  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 r21
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000010
 2   REGISTER      HIDDEN       W          NONE     64     64       1       INT                       rflags
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [    FLAGS ] ============================================================================================
    ACTIONS: [CF  : M  ] [PF  : 0  ] [AF  : 0  ] [ZF  : M  ] [SF  : 0  ] [OF  : 0  ] 
       READ: 0x00000000
    WRITTEN: 0x000008D5

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 128
  BROADCAST: NONE
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k0 [DISABLED]

== [      APX ] ============================================================================================
  USES_EGPR: Y
     HAS_NF: N
     HAS_ZU: N
        SCC: NONE

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: inveptx 0x10(%r21), %r20
   RELATIVE: inveptx 0x10(%r21), %r20

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: invept r20, xmmword ptr ds:[r21+0x10]
   RELATIVE: invept r20, xmmword ptr ds:[r21+0x10]

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
62 EC 7E 08 F0 65 10 
:           :  :  :..DISP
:           :  :..MODRM
:           :..OPCODE
:..EVEX
